### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

###

### sem token
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPastos HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### token inválido
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPastos HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

###

### dados inválidos
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "",
    "areatotal": -3
}

###

### teste de inserção de pasto
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Leste",
    "areatotal": 15.30
}

###

### teste de buscar todos os pastos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPastos HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de buscar pasto por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de atualização de pasto
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePasto/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Norte",
    "areatotal": 13.00
}

###

### teste de exclusão lógica (recusada enquanto houver piquetes ativos)
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePasto/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
